An expression that selects between alternatives based on a boolean or ${fref("/01-programming-language-theory/02-concepts/pattern-matching.td")} (like if b then x else y or ternary b ? x : y).

An **expression** that selects between alternatives based on a boolean or pattern match (like `if b then x else y` or ternary `b ? x : y`).
